    robot config   lekiwiclientconfig remote ip  172 18 134 136   id lekiwi  
    teleop arm config   so100leaderconfig port   dev tty usbmodem585a0077581   id awesome leader arm  
    keyboard config   keyboardteleopconfig id laptop keyboard  

     
    robot   lekiwiclient robot config 
    leader arm   so100leader teleop arm config 
    keyboard   keyboardteleop keyboard config 

     
     
    robot connect  
    leader arm connect  
    keyboard connect  

     
    init rerun session name  lekiwi teleop robot connected leader arm connected keyboard connected valueerror  robot teleop connected   

    print  starting teleop loop t0   time perf counter  

         
        observation   robot observation  

         
         
        arm action   leader arm action  
        arm action    f arm  k    v k  v arm action items   
         
        keyboard keys   keyboard action  
        base action   robot keyboard base action keyboard keys 

        action      arm action    base action len base action    0 arm action

         
            robot send action action 

         
        log rerun data observation observation  action action 

        precise sleep max 1 0   fps -  time perf counter   - t0   0 0 name         main    
    main  
  examples lekiwi teleoperate